" source="category-1" target="subtopic-1-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-1-4-0" value="正手网前挑球技巧！羽毛球普通挑球和超短发力立腕弹挑！学会就很省力了&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 29&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ls421T79c/"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1111" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-37" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-1-4" target="video-1-4-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-1-4-1" value="反手网前挑球技巧！羽毛球想挑的又高又到位必看&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 18&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Gs421u7zw/"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1189" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-38" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-1-4" target="video-1-4-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-1-5" value="&lt;b&gt;网前框架与步法&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;13 条 · 关键词：网前框架、网前步法、上网、持拍" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="1280" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-39" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-1" target="subtopic-1-5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-1-5-0" value="什么是变速？ 怎么做手上变速和脚上的变速！附送高质量吊上网训练方法&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 15&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WV4y1v7tM/"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1276" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-40" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-1-5" target="video-1-5-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-1-5-1" value="羽毛球单打吊上网球路！初阶四方球拉吊训练&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 14&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19S421Q7Mf/"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1354" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-41" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-1-5" target="video-1-5-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-1-6" value="&lt;b&gt;网前综合待细分&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;7 条 · 关键词：" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="1445" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-42" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-1" target="subtopic-1-6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-1-6-0" value="双打网前意识 双打只要能让球往下飞，对面回球就是往上飞的，不一定要打硬，打软点对面更难借力&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7504391919716273468"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1441" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-43" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-1-6" target="video-1-6-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-1-6-1" value="总之球必须向我们飞来才有练的价值。不需要网，网前练的就是控球感，练自由使用技术，有面墙就行&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7078487171803467042"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1519" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-44" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-1-6" target="video-1-6-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="category-2" value="&lt;b&gt;中前场与抽挡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;53 条 · 平抽挡、接杀、防反及中前场高速衔接。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E7EDF5;strokeColor=#456A8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="320" width="620" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-45" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="skill" target="category-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-2-0" value="&lt;b&gt;平抽挡与高速对抗&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;8 条 · 关键词：平抽挡、抽挡、压抽、快挡" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="455" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-46" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-2" target="subtopic-2-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-2-0-0" value="8166 抽挡细节 会了抽挡动作，做动作的节奏才是最重要的&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 18&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7667841485241148145"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="451" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-47" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-2-0" target="video-2-0-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-2-0-1" value="羽毛球万能平抽挡教学！职业级抽档握拍细节！进阶必学 平抽档直接进入专业级&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 18&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y5kMY9ELd/"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="529" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-48" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-2-0" target="video-2-0-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-2-1" value="&lt;b&gt;接杀与防反&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;40 条 · 关键词：接杀、挡杀、防反、防守反击" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="620" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-49" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-2" target="subtopic-2-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-2-1-0" value="反手接杀怎么握拍？大拇指顶在哪？羽毛球单打双打接杀常见握拍方法&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 31&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18V3Ez2ECs/"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="616" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-50" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-2-1" target="video-2-1-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-2-1-1" value="接杀球从0到1完整版教学！学就学最牛逼的接杀顶后场！防守小白线下版教学&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 25&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zLStYgE6i/"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="694" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-51" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-2-1" target="video-2-1-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-2-2" value="&lt;b&gt;中前场衔接&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;4 条 · 关键词：中前场、封网、抢点、抽压" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="785" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-52" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-2" target="subtopic-2-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-2-2-0" value="双打封网何时举拍？！花絮——1拍20万赞的球！羽毛球双打封网举拍标准示范！花絮真的笑死了&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 21&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HFygBuENk/"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="781" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-53" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-2-2" target="video-2-2-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-2-2-1" value="羽毛球双打封网教学！黄雅琼正反手封网技巧揭秘！12分钟极限干货&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 18&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Zx2wYdEHs/"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="859" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-54" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-2-2" target="video-2-2-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-2-3" value="&lt;b&gt;中前场综合待细分&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 条 · 关键词：" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="950" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-55" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-2" target="subtopic-2-3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-2-3-0" value="步法节奏 越着急跑输的越快，中场待着不动也不行，所以只能去找到这个接球的节奏&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7571574635323124145"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="946" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-56" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-2-3" target="video-2-3-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="category-3" value="&lt;b&gt;步法与移动&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;91 条 · 启动、回动、不同步型、重心与场区移动。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3EBCF;strokeColor=#967326;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2370" y="320" width="620" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-57" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="skill" target="category-3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-3-0" value="&lt;b&gt;启动与预动&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;39 条 · 关键词：启动、预动、起动、第一步" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2370" y="455" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-58" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-3" target="subtopic-3-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-0-0" value="打球时启动是听击球声吗？到底什么才是正确的启动时机！没有童子功基础的要仔细听了，不然再打十年你可能还是不会…&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 48&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1H1421Q75w/"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="451" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-59" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-0" target="video-3-0-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-0-1" value="为什么打球时启动步做不出来？启动步快速移动的奥秘！不看又错过一个亿&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 35&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16u4m1N7VP/"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="529" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-60" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-0" target="video-3-0-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-3-1" value="&lt;b&gt;回动与下一拍&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;24 条 · 关键词：回动、回位、还原、下一拍" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2370" y="620" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-61" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-3" target="subtopic-3-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-1-0" value="这属于为了下一拍更好衔接的步法，也是使用率最高的&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 20&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7229889111706848544"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="616" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-62" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-1" target="video-3-1-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-1-1" value="并不是说一定要一步回位。而是体现向左回动，左脚的重要性&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;reviewed_transcript · score 19&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7059589039694957864"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="694" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-63" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-1" target="video-3-1-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-3-2" value="&lt;b&gt;交叉步、并步与垫步&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;19 条 · 关键词：交叉步、并步、垫步、马来步" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2370" y="785" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-64" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-3" target="subtopic-3-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-2-0" value="初学用并步or交叉步？实战步法不是你想的那样&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 24&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oH4y1n7s7/"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="781" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-65" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-2" target="video-3-2-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-2-1" value="发个老库存，垫步和并步都接双脚起跳的合适步法&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 12&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7064753436809514281"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="859" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-66" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-2" target="video-3-2-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-3-3" value="&lt;b&gt;低重心与被动救球&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 条 · 关键词：低重心、被动步法、救球、跑动不到位" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2370" y="950" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-67" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-3" target="subtopic-3-3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-3-0" value="1 白鞋白胶布2低重心步法回动3低重心步法训练，这是我自创训练&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 29&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7085169366005714217"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="946" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-68" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-3" target="video-3-3-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-3-1" value="后场就是刻意练的被动步法，不是不积极，主要练回动的节奏感&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 9&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7280727710740139264"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="1024" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-69" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-3" target="video-3-3-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-3-4" value="&lt;b&gt;场区移动&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;6 条 · 关键词：前后步法、网前步法、后场步法、正手区步法" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2370" y="1115" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-70" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-3" target="subtopic-3-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-4-0" value="正手区前后步法（基础版） 正手区前后步法种类非常多，这是一种比较简单合理的步法，而且教学对象是左手，左右手…&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 18&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7567860375287303035"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="1111" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-71" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-4" target="video-3-4-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-4-1" value="正手网前步法 当然还要注意左手的摆放和重心的控制，但是时间有限，直播的时候讲吧&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 9&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7406541084219821312"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="1189" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-72" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-4" target="video-3-4-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-3-5" value="&lt;b&gt;步法综合待细分&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;16 条 · 关键词：" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2370" y="1280" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-73" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-3" target="subtopic-3-5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-5-0" value="挂臂三招，由我腿伤时所创，专门用于步法慢的或者懒得动的人，属于绝活技能，绝对不伤腕，想学哪个？还有我是正经…&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;visual_reviewed · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7167546787073477900"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="1276" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-74" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-5" target="video-3-5-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-3-5-1" value="下手步伐加速 右手球员的右脚就算在很快的节奏里，也要尽量有一个回复的动作，不然节奏容易断&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7670988159002607355"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="1354" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-75" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-3-5" target="video-3-5-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="category-4" value="&lt;b&gt;发力与身体运用&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;380 条 · 放松传导、身体旋转、内外旋、击球空间与挥拍路径。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E9E3F2;strokeColor=#72578C;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1360" width="620" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-76" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="skill" target="category-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-4-0" value="&lt;b&gt;放松、传导与爆发&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;53 条 · 关键词：放松发力、力量传导、爆发、打透" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1495" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-77" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-4" target="subtopic-4-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-0-0" value="大发力的杀球是什么感觉？ 杀球爆发力训练方法和原理 偷偷说一下这是VIP课的内容&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 18&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18KqWYmEx7/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="1491" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-78" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-0" target="video-4-0-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-0-1" value="提升挥速的秘诀是什么？球速、挥速、爆发力、静止框架！ 一次讲清楚&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 18&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15e411Q713/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="1569" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-79" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-0" target="video-4-0-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-4-1" value="&lt;b&gt;腰腹、核心与转体&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;61 条 · 关键词：腰腹、核心、转体、转髋" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1660" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-80" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-4" target="subtopic-4-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-1-0" value="腰腹发力 手放好位置，感受腰腹发力的方向，只有把方向做对，击球才能有效果&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 21&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7494729488699559225"><mxGeometry x="390" y="1656" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-81" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-1" target="video-4-1-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-1-1" value="爆改球友 转髋还有问题，不过可以先熟悉动作了，其他的问题可以有了转髋后再微调&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 18&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7492357671853526329"><mxGeometry x="390" y="1734" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-82" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-1" target="video-4-1-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-4-2" value="&lt;b&gt;小臂旋转与手腕&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;113 条 · 关键词：内旋、外旋、小臂旋转、手腕" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1825" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-83" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-4" target="subtopic-4-2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-2-0" value="后场发力手腕怎么用？如此这般 终于会用手腕了！羽毛球大发力手腕力传导的方法&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 38&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bF6SYtEGz/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="1821" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-84" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-2" target="video-4-2-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-2-1" value="手腕在发力中的正确用法！羽毛球正反手发力手腕技巧&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 32&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DH5uzFEUS/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="1899" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-85" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-2" target="video-4-2-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-4-3" value="&lt;b&gt;击球空间与发力点&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;71 条 · 关键词：贴球、发力空间、击球点、高点" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1990" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-86" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-4" target="subtopic-4-3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-3-0" value="跳杀怎样有滞空感？最高点击球对吗？滞空详细教学完整版&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 21&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1y4421F7KV/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="1986" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-87" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-3" target="video-4-3-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-3-1" value="跳杀找不到击球点怎么办？ 找正确的击球点最快的方法！真的绝了&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 21&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DW4y1A7fx/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="2064" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-88" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-3" target="video-4-3-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-4-4" value="&lt;b&gt;挥拍路径&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;144 条 · 关键词：挥拍路径、基础挥拍、随挥、随摆" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="2155" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-89" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-4" target="subtopic-4-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-4-0" value="甩大臂vs随摆！大臂是如何带动小臂发力的！正确的羽毛球发力核心动作怎么做&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 36&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1P4DGYrE8B/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="2151" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-90" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-4" target="video-4-4-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-4-1" value="羽毛球杀球怎么杀得快？快杀理论知识+动作示范！P.S抡大臂就不可能快&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 29&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EADqYPEjo/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="2229" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-91" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-4" target="video-4-4-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-4-5" value="&lt;b&gt;发力综合待细分&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;29 条 · 关键词：" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="2320" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-92" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-4" target="subtopic-4-5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-5-0" value="【羽毛球发力】慢球为什么难接？教你一个练习找到慢球节奏！不用借力一样发力&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1TdHZz2EG3/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="2316" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-93" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-5" target="video-4-5-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-4-5-1" value="为什么新手不要学闪动发力？不仅是100%学不会的原因！循序渐进！听劝&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Dg7WzyEyM/"><mxGeometry x="390" y="2394" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-94" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-4-5" target="video-4-5-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="category-5" value="&lt;b&gt;握拍与拍面&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;59 条 · 正反手握拍、握拍转换、手指发力和拍面控制。" style="rou