/></mxCell><mxCell id="video-8-3-1" value="吊球和刹球要相互配合使用，拉扯对手防守的站位，一味的强攻很容易被防反&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;visual_reviewed · score 9&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7115241358255803683"><mxGeometry x="390" y="3104" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-157" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-8-3" target="video-8-3-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-8-4" value="&lt;b&gt;单打综合待细分&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;20 条 · 关键词：" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="3195" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-158" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-8" target="subtopic-8-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-8-4-0" value="减少失误 一个球总失误，除了动作不熟练，还有可能是人的节奏和球速不匹配，因为节奏陌生而产生的失误&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7630800123594285305"><mxGeometry x="390" y="3191" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-159" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-8-4" target="video-8-4-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-8-4-1" value="单打技术 借用一下三位健将和我昔日对抗的素材，感谢&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FBFA;strokeColor=#CBD6D2;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://www.douyin.com/video/7376838935164505384"><mxGeometry x="390" y="3269" width="290" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-160" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="subtopic-8-4" target="video-8-4-1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="category-9" value="&lt;b&gt;装备选择&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;70 条 · 与动作能力直接相关的球拍、球线和参数选择，不包含商品推广。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7E6DE;strokeColor=#B85C38;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="2400" width="620" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-161" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="skill" target="category-9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtopic-9-0" value="&lt;b&gt;球拍选择与重量&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;66 条 · 关键词：选择球拍、球拍重量、重量球拍、拍重" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#AAB8B4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="2535" width="300" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-162" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7A8A86;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="category-9" target="subtopic-9-0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="video-9-0-0" value="解读新手为何爱打3u球拍？球拍重量与发力的关系！听劝 新手想快速学会发力 选5u就对了&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#52625E'&gt;medium · score 36&lt;/font&gt;" styl